# Applies to builds whose context is the repo root — currently only the
# control-plane service (docker-compose.yml sets context: . for it so its
# Dockerfile can COPY the top-level policies/ seed). The egress proxy uses its
# own context (proxies/egress) and is unaffected.
#
# Keep the root build context tiny: the control-plane image needs only
# control-plane/ and policies/. Everything else is noise.
.git
.github
claude-sandbox
control-plane-ui
proxies
run-claude-sandbox.sh
Makefile
*.md
.hadolint.yaml
.shellcheckrc
.yamllint
